Package: energypal
Title: Energy-Focused Color Palettes for Data Visualization
Version: 0.0.0.9000
URL: https://github.com/optimal2050/energypal
BugReports: https://github.com/optimal2050/energypal/issues
Authors@R: 
    person("Energy", "Developer", , "developer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: Provides curated color palettes and intelligent mapping functions 
    specifically designed for energy-related data visualizations. Includes 
    palettes inspired by major energy organizations (IEA, EPA, EIA) and smart 
    functions for mapping energy sources (coal, natural gas, renewables, etc.) 
    to appropriate colors. Extends ggplot2 with specialized scale functions for 
    fuel mix charts, choropleth maps, and other energy sector visualizations.
